The change meets the task and the worker's definition of done. Seat checks run under the store lock, so the invite race is covered. Both 402 and 409 bodies, `GET /v1/org` `seats`, and the viewer-to-member and plan-downgrade rules all match the spec. Accept never checks seats, and the pending-invite count excludes accepted and revoked invites. I found no other path that gives a member a non-viewer role without the check. Accepting an invite goes through `addMember` and is not gated, which is what the spec asks for.

Nothing needs revising. The one thing I'd note as optional is that `UpdateOrg` only checks seats when the plan actually changes. That is correct, since an org already over its limit cannot be reached through any other path.

{"verdict":"SHIP","feedback":""}

